'''Combat Boots''' are a [[footwear]] item in Stardew Valley. They can be purchased from the [[Adventurer's Guild]] after reaching floor 40 in the mines or found in [[Fishing#Treasure Chests|Fishing Treasure Chests]] after reaching [[Fishing#Fishing Skill|Fishing level 2]]. They can be found as a [[The Mines#Special Items|special item]] on floors 61-79 of [[The Mines]] by killing [[The Mines#Special Items|special monsters]] or by breaking [[The Mines#Crates and Barrels|crates and barrels]]. They are a possible reward for the chest on floor 50 of the Mines if "remixed" mine rewards are selected in the [[Options|Advanced Options]] menu when starting a new game.

==History==
{{History|1.5|Added the possibility to be found in the chest on floor 50 of the Mines with "remixed" mine rewards.}}

